flowchart LR
    B[Borrower portal] --> A[Authenticate and authorize loan]
    A --> L[Server-filtered document list]
    A --> U[Upload-only folder token]
    A --> F[Authorize requested file and metadata]
    F --> P[File-scoped preview token]
    U --> X[Box uploads]
    P --> D[One permitted Box document]

  Sign[Box-confirmed signed request] --> Release[Publish verified final copies as Executed]
  Release --> Receipt[Retain exact output IDs and request ID]
  Receipt --> Closed[Close loan after outputs are ready]
  Receipt --> Check[Check output remains in mapped loan folder]
  Check --> Preview[Borrower file-scoped preview]
